activities.","context":"Our Chief Executive Officer Ms. Christy Poon brings extensive expertise in mergers & acquisitions, intellectual property, public relations, and media marketing. She is a Partner at Norwich Capital Limited, where she oversees corporate reorganization, fundraising, IP asset management, and advisory on U.S. public listings across Asia. Her prior leadership roles include Vice President of Corporate Affairs & Operations at XIC Innovation Limited and General Manager positions at JM Production and JM Network, complemented by early experience in public relations and advanced academic credentials in business, communications, and mediation.","section":"Business Combination Agreement with Mingde Technology Limited","block":108,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001683168-26-002441","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-31","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002020987","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2020987/000168316826002441/yhn_i10k-123125.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8d7fe7c7476858b874605a002bc37510b229c5deeb301b163ac48877b5be93d8.bin","sha256":"8d7fe7c7476858b874605a002bc37510b229c5deeb301b163ac48877b5be93d8"}},{"id":"05398c74b61abaae3db44f5eee847313a725dcdac42d98de8844529cf329e330","quote":"Our management team has been actively involved in operating, advising, and expanding many companies. Their executive leadership, operational oversight, strategic management will boost investor confidence in the team’s ability to complete a successful business combination. We believe our management team is well-positioned to take advantage of growing acquisition opportunities.","context":"Ms. Yangyujia An, our Chief Financial Officer, is the vice-chairperson of Norwich Capital Limited, a boutique firm that focuses on SPACs and provides services including sponsoring and listing support of SPACs. Prior to that, she also worked as an investment manager at Norwich Investment Limited. We believe that Ms. An’s experiences, in particular those in relation to SPACs, will be valuable for our initial business combination activities.","section":"Business Combination Agreement with Mingde Technology Limited","block":109,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001683168-26-002441","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-31","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002020987","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2020987/000168316826002441/yhn_i10k-123125.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8d7fe7c7476858b874605a002bc37510b229c5deeb301b163ac48877b5be93d8.bin","sha256":"8d7fe7c7476858b874605a002bc37510b229c5deeb301b163ac48877b5be93d8"}},{"id":"b243103d8eb32f1d087f574c7598a7aef8bc02e02719835d5338b2c9a035979a","quote":"We have recruited an accomplished group of leaders to serve as members of our board of directors. Our board of directors comes from a plethora of industries where they serve as leaders, advisors, directors, and board members for public companies, private companies, and leading venture capital firms in Asia.","context":"Strong Board of Directors","section":"Business Combination Agreement with Mingde Technology Limited","block":111,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001683168-26-002441","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-31","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002020987","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2020987/000168316826002441/yhn_i10k-123125.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8d7fe7c7476858b874605a002bc37510b229c5deeb301b163ac48877b5be93d8.bin","sha256":"8d7fe7c7476858b874605a002bc37510b229c5deeb301b163ac48877b5be93d8"}},{"id":"9229bd3cf553a8409a14f091a05445a833308a1366efa8cfb3a34c29d1de9c80","quote":"Mr. Zhengming Feng, our chairman and independent director, was a former Managing Director of SB China Venture Capital (SBCVC), a leading venture capital firm 